! IEEE 123-Bus Test Feeder -- OpenDSS Master File
! Source: EPRI OpenDSS Test Case Library
! Nominal Voltage: 4.16 kV (line-to-line)
! Configuration: Radial, unbalanced three-phase

Clear

New Circuit.IEEE123Bus
~ basekv=4.16 pu=1.0 phases=3 bus1=150 angle=30
~ MVASC3=200000 MVASC1=210000

! Voltage source impedance (represents substation transformer)
New Transformer.Sub phases=3 windings=2 XHL=8
~ wdg=1 bus=150 conn=delta kv=4.16 kva=5000 %r=0.5
~ wdg=2 bus=149 conn=wye kv=4.16 kva=5000 %r=0.5

! Load line codes
Redirect IEEELineCodes.dss

